- **Svc::Ccs,ds::CmdDecoder**: Command decoder for CCSDS

### **Directory Structure**
```
<deployment_name>/
├── Top/                // Top-level topology
│   ├── topology.fpp    // Main topology file
│   └── Subtopologies/  // Core subtopologies (Svc.CdhCore, etc.)
├── Components/         // Custom component implementations
├── Ports/              // Custom port definitions
├── CMakeLists.txt      // Build configuration
└── src/                // Generated source files
