- `SOURCE_FILES` in `CMakeLists.txt` lists all `.fpp` files to compile
- The `Top/topology.fpp` file wires together all subtopologies and components

These components form a functional baseline for mission-specific development, with separation between framework code (subtopologies) and mission-specific implementations (components/ports).

